VALUES (10, 'Counter-Strike', 88, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/halflifecounterstrike', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p>Play the world''s number 1 online action game. Engage in an incredibly realistic brand of terrorist warfare in this wildly popular team-based game. Ally with teammates to complete strategic missions. Take out enemy sites. Rescue hostages. Your role affects your team''s success. Your team''s success affects your role.</p>', 'header.jpg');


