-- Package information
-- Media for parent App ID 10000 (from page App ID: 10050)
<p><p>The ultimate online strategic shooter is now better than ever. This demo lets you sample the newly-updated version of the objective-driven, class-based shooter set in the Quake universe.</p>
<p>In addition to a variety of gameplay balance improvements, Enemy Territory: QUAKE Wars includes a new training mode that introduces the unique gameplay concepts and mechanics. The updated User Interface includes an improved Server Browser, which now recommends three ''Hot Servers'' that will get you into the game at the start of a campaign with the confidence of an excellent connection; the option for an advanced or simplified HUD mode to reduce or increase HUD complexibility; and an improved Mission End Screen that displays a wealth of new stats. In addition to many other enhancements, Enemy Territory: QUAKE Wars now supports auto-downloading of new maps and content.</p></p>', 'capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1260565646');

-- Quantum of Solace (App ID: 10080)
VALUES (10080, 'Quantum of Solace', 70, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/quantumofsolace', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>BOND IS BACK. Blending first person shooting and third person cover combat, Quantum of Solace the Game puts you in control of Bond''s greatest weapon  his mind. Based on both the Quantum of Solace and Casino Royale films, Quantum of Solace the Game puts you in the midst of the high-octane world of international espionage and intrigue.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>YOU ARE THE NEW BOND: </strong>Employ all of your Bond skills including tactical combat, precision shooting, crushing takedowns and deadly stealth.</li>
<li><strong>TAKE COVER: </strong>First person shooting with third person cover combat allows you to adjust your gameplay to meet each challenge. </li>
<li><strong>FIGHT WORTHY ADVERSARIES: </strong>Advanced AI systems allow enemies to react to you in intelligent and tactical ways.  </li>
<li><strong>THE NEW WORLD OF BOND: </strong>Immerse yourself in world of Bond with characters from both films and missions that take you through exotic real world locations. </li>
<li><strong>BECOME THE WORLDS PREMIER MI6 AGENT: </strong>Go online with standard 12-player multiplayer modes plus unique Bond modes. </li> </ul></p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (10080, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'T');



