<li><strong>Memory: </strong>At least 512Mb RAM, 1024 Mb RAM recommended</li>
<li><strong>Hard Drive: </strong>7800 MB of uncompressed hard disk space (plus 400 MB for the Windows swap file)</li>
<li><strong>DirectX version: </strong>DirectX 9.0c</li>
