VALUES (10120, 'Aces of the Galaxy', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>3, 2, 1 Blast-Off! Launch yourself into the intense space-shooter Aces of the Galaxy  A non-stop, old-school arcade thrill-ride for the 21st century and beyond. Utilize an impressive arsenal of upgradeable weapons including high powered missile launchers, devastating torpedoes and the ever-reliant chain gun to annihilate the ships of the wretched Skurgian Empire. </p>
