-- Pro Cycling Manager - Tour de France 2009 (App ID: 11120)
VALUES (11120, 'Pro Cycling Manager - Tour de France 2009', 69, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/procyclingmanagertourdefrance2009', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Experience the intense thrill of a great cycling season!</p>
<p>Pro Cycling Manager/Tour de France 2009 invites you to experience an extensive new season packed with more than 180 races including the greatest competitions such as the Tour de France.  Lead one of the 65 official teams or create your own team (new feature) and tackle the toughest challenges: win a big Tour, excel throughout an entire season, increase a new talent''s odds or reinforce a great champion.  Objectives are many and will allow you to play as you want, for the glory or just for fun.</p>
<p>During the race, you intervene directly on your team''s tactics and strategies.  As the general manager, you will also be in charge of your riders through the season, as well as of the contracts, the equipment, transfers, calendar, trainings and every daily task of a professional manager.</p>
<ul>
<li>An exceptional season loaded with 180 races and nearly 720 playable legs.
			<li>Create your own team or take the lead of one of the 65 official teams: (Saxo Bank, Rabobank, Quick Step…)
			<li>Gain experience through the competitions, manage human resources, formation issues, finances…and climb to the top of sports management.
			<li>Many novelties like the possibility for the player to create his own team and an improved graphic engine for a better immersion during the race.  New podiums, new game modes, online ranking, new leaderboards and more!
			<li>Create and share your own 3D stages thanks to the race editor.
			<li>Play alone and/or in multiplayer up to 20 players over the Internet or on LAN
			</li></li></li></li></li></li></ul></p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (11120, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'E');



<ul>
<li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows XP SP2/VISTA</li>
<li><strong>Processor:</strong> PENTIUM4 2.2GHZ/ATHLONXP 2200+ Processor</li>
