<li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card 128 MB 100% DIRECTX 9 compatible and shaders 2.0 support (NVIDIA GEFORCEFX 5900/ATI RADEON 9600/INTEL GMA X3100 or above)*</li>
<li><strong>DirectX�:</strong> </li>
