-- Grand Theft Auto (App ID: 12170)
VALUES (12170, 'Grand Theft Auto', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Drive dozens of varied vehicles around three of America''s toughest cities.</p>
<p>Only the best will be able to tame the fastest cars. Only the smartest will know all the short-cuts and the whereabouts of the hottest wheels.</p>
