<ul>
<li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft� Windows� XP/Vista</li>
<li><strong>Processor:</strong> Pentium� 4 1.4 GHz or 100% compatible</li>
<li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM</li>
<li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 64 MB AGP DirectX� 9 and T&amp;L compatible video accelerator card</li>
