<li><strong>Graphics: </strong> 32 MB DirectX 9.0 compatible video card </li>
<li><strong>Sound: </strong> DirectX compatible sound card </li>
<li><strong>DirectX Version: </strong>DirectX 9.0</li>
<li><strong>Memory: </strong> 256 MB RAM</li>
