VALUES (13700, 'Savage 2: A Tortured Soul', 75, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/savage2atorturedsoul', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Journey back to the fantasy realm of Newerth to continue the epic battle between humans and beasts.  Savage 2 combines real-time strategy and first person action in a dynamic multiplayer environment. </p>
<p>Choose your side, human or beast, and select one of seven different class types to take to the battlefield in intense first person combat.  Feel like taking the reins? Choose to be a commander to play an in-depth RTS game that lets you lead your troops into battle as you build structures to unlock offensive and defensive capabilities.  It''s all waiting for you in Savage 2.</p></p>', 'header.jpg');


