-- Cold Fear (App ID: 15270)
VALUES (15270, 'Cold Fear', 66, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/coldfear', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>In a ferocious Arctic storm, distress signals are sent from a mysterious Russian whaler. As leading Coast Guard veteran Tom Hansen, you board to investigate  and discover unthinkable horrors lurking beneath the ship''s bloodstained decks.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Brave dangerous waters:</strong> Rocked by huge breakers, you must steady your nerves  and aim  to evade a watery grave.</li>
<li><strong>Keep your bearings:</strong> Battle against increasingly mutated enemies in treacherous, unstable environments.</li>
<li><strong>Unleash a torrent of weapons:</strong> Create fatal traps and use shotguns, flame throwers, or any object you can find to survive.</li></ul></p>', 'header.jpg');


