-- The Office (App ID: 15940)
VALUES (15940, 'The Office', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Those who think they could survive the zany workplace scenarios featured in NBC''s comedy The Office can soon put the absurd to the test with an all-new game based on the Emmy Award-winning television series. Immerse yourself in the hilarious environment by maneuvering through the quirkiness - whether it''s a dysfunctional fax machine or idiosyncrasies of oddball co-workers  while spending a year at the Scranton branch of the Dunder Mifflin Paper Company. The frenzied fun of The Office game will have you competing to be the best paper salesperson  and playing pranks to slow down rival players who might be getting ahead!</p>
<ul>
<li>In-game caricatures of cast favorites</li>
<li>Season variations at the Scranton office</li>
<li>Collectible in-game items inspired by the show</li>
<li>Computer-controlled rival competition</li>
<li>Humorous pranks</li></ul></p>', 'header.jpg');


