</ul>');




-- Package information
-- Day of Defeat (App ID: 30)
VALUES (30, 'Day of Defeat', 79, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/dayofdefeat', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p>Enlist in an intense brand of Axis vs. Allied teamplay set in the WWII European Theatre of Operations. Players assume the role of light/assault/heavy infantry, sniper or machine-gunner class, each with a unique arsenal of historical weaponry at their disposal. Missions are based on key historical operations. And, as war rages, players must work together with their squad to accomplish a variety of mission-specific objectives.</p>', 'header.jpg');


