<ul>
<li><span class="copyHead">Cutting-edge technology:</span> Experience an enhanced version of the famous Source Engine created by Valve. Discover the fresh perspective of a view with complete body awareness, realistic movements, physics rendering, and a complete first-person melee combat system in a fantasy setting.</li>
