<li><strong>Processor: </strong>Pentium II 450, AMD K6 III 500 or equivalent  </li>
<li><strong>System Memory: </strong>128 MB RAM  </li>
<li><strong>Video Card: </strong>16 MB DirectX 8 compatible 3D card (Voodoo cards are not supported) </li>
<li><strong>Sound Card: </strong>DirectX 8 compatible sound card </li>
