-- Street Fighter� IV sur Steam (App ID: 21660)
VALUES (21660, 'Street Fighter� IV sur Steam', 91, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/streetfighter4', '<h2>A propos du jeu</h2>
<p><p>Street Fighter� IV revient aux origines avec les mouvements et les techniques de Street Fighter� II, et comprend les dernières technologies pour vous apporter le meilleur des arts martiaux virtuels.</p>
<p>Tout ce qui a fait le nom et le succès de Street Fighter II fait partie intégrante de Street Fighter IV.  Les joueurs peuvent incarner leurs personnages favoris comme Ryu, Ken, Chun-Li ou Guile, ainsi que de nouveaux personnages comme Crimson Viper, Abel, El Fuerte, et Rufus. Les personnages et les environnements sont en 3D. Alors que le jeu se déroule en 2D comme dans le jeu original. Six touches vous permettront de contrôler le jeu. Un nouveau jeu de combat vient de voir le jour. </p>
<p>
<ul>
<li>Environnements haute définition et personnages en 3D </li>
<li>Contrôles traditionnels comme dans le jeu original  "2D" Street Fighter  </li>
<li>25 combattants incluant : 
					<ul>
<li>Les combattants classiques, redessinés pour la nouvelle génération </li>
<li>Nouveaux arrivants  : la super espionne Crimson Viper, le lutteur El Fuerte, MMA artiste  artist Abel et plus encore ! </li></ul></li>
<li>Nouveaux mouvements spéciaux fantastiques. Sont inclus : Attaques Focus, Super Combos et le système Ultra Combo</li>
<li>Jouabilité progressive qui conviendra aux vétérans comme aux nouveaux venus </li>
<li>Mode de jeu en ligne </li></ul></p></p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (21660, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'T');





-- Package information
-- Bionic Commando (App ID: 21670)
VALUES (21670, 'Bionic Commando', 69, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/bioniccommando', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>The first true sequel to the classic 1988 Nintendo Entertainment System original, Bionic Commando sees the return of the bionically-enhanced Nathan "R.A.D." Spencer. Time has not been kind to Spencer: Five years after his heroic defeat of the Imperials, he has been betrayed by the government he swore to serve, imprisoned for crimes he didn''t commit, and sentenced to death.</p>
<p>On the very day of Spencer''s execution, terrorists detonate a massive experimental weapon in Ascension City, unleashing an intense earthquake that has turned the city into rubble and wiped out its population. With the terrain in ruins and the city''s air defense grid now in the control of a massive terrorist force whose goal remains unclear, the FSA have only one option left - a behind-the-lines assault. </p>
<p>It''s the perfect job for a Bionic Commando. </p>
<p>Bionic Commando transposes the much loved swing-and-shoot gameplay of the 8-bit original onto a stunning 3D environment of towering buildings, suspended roadways and monorails, deep canyons and sheer rock faces, which are traversed using swinging, scaling, climbing and wall-walking techniques. </p>
<ul>
<li>Use the bionic arm to swing between towering skyscrapers at breathtaking speed, hook onto distant objects, zip up on hanging girders and choose your own route through the game </li>
<li>Gameplay that moves through horizontal and vertical environments - a 3D game that truly uses all three dimensions. Full multiplayer mode with rich stat-tracking to check whether you''re a true commando or a lowly private </li>
<li>Use the power of the bionic arm - and of next-gen physics - to realistically throw massive objects, pummel opponents, whip enemies into the air, or pull the landscape apart </li>
<li>Arm yourself with a variety of weapons worthy of a Bionic Commando </li>
<li>Starring Mike Patton, the former lead singer of Faith No More as the voice of Nathan Spencer </li>
<li>Developed by Swedish studio GRIN, developers of the highly acclaimed Ghost Recon: Advanced Warfighter series for PC </li>
</ul>
<p>Bionic Commando takes advantage of the Steam Cloud by storing your save games in the cloud. Simply pick up where you left off when you log into your Steam account on any PC.</p>
<p>Players who own both Bionic Commando and <a href="http://store.steampowered.com/app/21680/">Bionic Commando Rearmed</a> will enjoy access to three unlockables in Bionic Commando, including the "Retro" Nathan "R.A.D." Spencer skin, a Prototype Weapon and a secret room in the Fissure level.</p></p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (21670, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);



