-- Package information
-- EverQuest� Secrets of Faydwer Starter Pack sur Steam (App ID: 24120)
VALUES (24120, 'EverQuest� Secrets of Faydwer Starter Pack sur Steam', '<h2>A propos du jeu</h2>
<p>
<p><i>EverQuest� Secrets of Faydwer</i> est la quatorzième extension de la série. Les personnages peuvent maintenant avancer au niveau 80 alors qu''ils combattent la menace grandissante. Chemin faisant, découvrez de nouveaux objets qui vont vous transporter vers de nouveaux sommets. <i>EverQuest Secrets of Faydwer</i> inclus également de nouveaux sorts et potentiels. </p>
<p>Histoire du jeu : </p>
<p>Défendez  Norrath contre les hordes ennemies. L''armée mécanisée du nécromancien Meldrath the Malignant est réunie. Elle est prête à fondre sur le royaume d''Ak''Anon. Le lancement de sa forteresse volante Mechanotus a permis d''ouvrir de nouveaux accès au continent inexploré de Faydwer. </p>
<p>Partez à la découverte de Faydwer et de la forteresse des Orcs de Bloodmoon.  Partez aider les humains et les elfes des collines de Shade.  Vous aurez également à vous soucier des dragons de Kerafyrm... </p>
<p>Comprend :</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Augmentation des niveaux :  </strong>niveau 80 disponible ! Nouveaux objets, potentiels et sortilèges ! </li>
<li><strong>15 nouvelles zones : </strong>Nouveaux royaumes pour les aventuriers. Sont inclus : Meldrath''s mechanical fortress Mechanotus, la pays de Loping Plains, et  Kerafyrm et ses grottes de cristal. </li>
<li><strong>Nouvelles histoires : </strong>Parcourez Faydwer en solo ou en groupe  et remplissez une centaine de nouvelles quêtes. 28 raids sont inclus. </li>
<li><strong>Nouveaux éléments héroïques  :  </strong>Augmentations pour l''agilité, l''endurance, la force, le charisme, la dextérité, l''intelligence et la sagesse. Augmentez vos statistiques ! </li>
<li>Jeu de Cartes en ligne de la <i>Legends of Norrath</i> inclus. <i>Legends of Norrath</i> est classé "E10+" pour des références à l''alcool, violence  et contenu suggestif. </li> </ul>
<p>Note : </p>
<p>Une souscription de 30 jours incluse n''est disponible que pour les nouveaux comptes (les comptes <i>EverQuest II</i> déjà existants ne sont pas destinés à recevoir cette offre). Par la suite, un abonnement mensuel de $14.99 s''applique (en plus des taxes respectives).</p>
<p>Ce jeu est destiné à être joué en ligne et nécessite une connexion aux serveurs Sony Online Entertainment par internet. Une carte bancaire est requise pour acheter ce jeu et pour payer l''abonnement nécessaire. </p>
<p>L''accord d''utilisation d''<i>EverQuest II</i> est nécessaire ainsi que l''acceptation de la licence du logiciel et les termes d''utilisation du service SOE et de sa politique. Sony Online Entertainment n''assure pas un accès continu au contenu du jeu, aux serveurs, aux fonctionnalités  et se réserve le droit de modifier, suspendre ou changer le contenu, les fonctionnalités et l''accès aux serveurs.</p>
<p><a href="http://help.station.sony.com/cgi-bin/soe.cfg/php/enduser/std_adp.php?p_faqid=12248" target="_blank">Conditions d''utilisation</a></p> </p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (24120, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'T');





-- Package information
-- EverQuest� Starter Pack (App ID: 24130)
VALUES (24130, 'EverQuest� Starter Pack', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p>
<p><i>EverQuest� Seeds of Destruction</i> is the fifteenth expansion to the genre-defining series. For the first time in <i>EverQuest</i> history, players can hire non-player characters (NPCs) to aid them in their heroic endeavors. These mercenaries will be valuable player assets as they thwart the efforts of Discord''s Dark God. <i>EverQuest Seeds of Destruction</i> also includes a level cap increase to 85, new dynamic high-level raid content, new spells, and new alternate advancement abilities. </p>
<p>Product Storyline:</p>
<p>A shining portal leads to a distant future where Riftseekers have used the Plane of Time to corrupt the very fabric of reality. The world has been shattered into millions of pieces that spin aimlessly through the void. On the largest of these pieces is a shadowy figure tending to a lone seedling tree  the last living remnant of Norrath. This lone soul is the fallen god Zebuxoruk and the only being who knows the secret to repairing the shattered world.</p>
<p>To prevent the cataclysm and defeat the forces of chaos, players must journey through time portals to the greatest moments in <i>EverQuest</i> history. From the founding of Qeynos to the battle of Bloody Kithicor, players will be called upon to safeguard history and ensure that events unfold without interference from the gods of Discord.</p>
<p>Feature Set: </p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Mercenaries  </strong>Need a hand with a tough battle? Hire a mercenary and crush the opposition! Player-controlled NPCs are now available! These role archetypes will scale to the appropriate level and will think and act for themselves with limited player guidance. Designed for extra support or extra muscle in PvE encounters, Mercenary archetypes include a variety of classes from all playable races. There are some rare non-playable races available to recruit as well! </li>
<li><strong>Level Cap Increase  </strong>Players can now achieve level 85! New high-level item sets, new alternate advancement ability lines and new spells await! </li>
<li><strong>20 New Zones  </strong>Features re-imagined classic content and brand-new realms for adventurers to explore, including the eerie wasteland of the Void, the epic battle of Bloody Kithicor and the ultimate heart of darkness in the Plane of Discord. </li>
<li>Includes all features and content from the 14 previous expansion packs. </li>
<li>Includes <i>Legends of Norrath</i> digital card game client, with starter deck, booster pack and loot item. <i>Legends of Norrath</i> is rated "E10+" for Alcohol Reference, Fantasy Violence, Mild Blood, and Suggestive Themes.</li>
<li>Also includes the unique "Rusty Steam Valve" in-game item.  One item per account.  Non-tradeable. No cash value.</li> </ul>
<p>Disclaimer: </p>
<p>30-day subscription included for new accounts only (existing <i>EverQuest</i> and Station Access accounts are not eligible to receive gameplay included with purchase). Afterwards, a Monthly Subscription Fee of $14.99 applies (plus applicable tax).</p>
<p>This is an Internet-only game which requires players to connect to Sony Online Entertainment''s servers via their own Internet connections. Players are responsible for their own Internet connection service and all Internet-related fees. A valid credit card is required to play this game and additional, recurring subscription fees apply. </p>
<p>Installation and play subject to the <i>EverQuest</i> User Agreement and Software License Agreement, game rules of conduct, SOE''s terms of service and SOE''s privacy policy.  Sony Online Entertainment does not ensure continuous or error-free access, use or availability of any game content, feature, game-play or server and may change, modify, disable, suspend or remove any such content, feature, game-play or server at its sole discretion.</p>
<p><a href="http://help.station.sony.com/cgi-bin/soe.cfg/php/enduser/std_adp.php?p_faqid=16210" target="_blank">Review Terms and Conditions</a></p> </p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (24130, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'T');






-- Package information
-- Pirates of the Burning Sea (App ID: 24140)
VALUES (24140, 'Pirates of the Burning Sea', 77, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/piratesoftheburningsea', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p>
<p>Set Sail With <i>Pirates of the Burning Sea</i>!</p>
<p><i>Pirates of the Burning Sea </i>is an MMORPG featuring high-seas action and adventure in a bold world of pirates and plunder. Set against the backdrop of the New World of the 18th century, players can choose one of three nations  England, France or Spain  or choose the role of a Pirate and battle it out for glory and power.</p>
<p>Key Features</p>
<ul>
<li>Join one of the four loyalties  France, Spain, England or Pirate. </li>
<li>Battle other players to control more than 80 conquerable ports in the Caribbean.  </li>
<li>Explore the world and make a name for yourself in more than 1,000 missions. </li>
<li>Vie for power and wealth with the fully player-driven economy. </li>
<li>Build, capture, and customize 158 historical ships. </li>
<li>Design your own personal flags, and customize sail decals.  </li>
<li>Choose from three different styles of combat  deadly and formal Fencing, flashy, dual wielding Florentine or rowdy and treacherous Dirty Fighting. </li> </ul>
<p>Disclaimer:</p>
<p>30-day subscription included for new accounts only (existing <i>Pirates of the Burning Sea</i> and Station Access accounts are not eligible to receive gameplay included with purchase). Afterwards, a Monthly Subscription Fee of $14.99 applies (plus applicable tax).</p>
<p>Installation and play subject to the Pirates of the Burning Sea User Agreement and Software License Agreement, game rules of conduct, SOE''s terms of service and SOE''s privacy policy.</p>
<p>This is an Internet-only game which requires players to connect to Flying Lab Software''s servers via their own Internet connections. Players are responsible for their own Internet connection service and all Internet-related fees. A valid credit card is required to play this game and additional, recurring subscription fees apply. </p>
<p>Sony Online Entertainment and Flying Lab Software do not ensure continuous or error-free access, use or availability of any game content, feature, game-play or server and may change, modify, disable, suspend or remove any such content, feature, game-play or server at their sole discretion.</p>
<p><a href="http://help.station.sony.com/cgi-bin/soe.cfg/php/enduser/std_adp.php?p_faqid=18354" target="_blank">Review Terms and Conditions</a> </p> </p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (24140, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'T');



<ul>
