-- Package information
-- Star Wars Galaxies: The Complete Online Adventures (App ID: 24170)
VALUES (24170, 'Star Wars Galaxies: The Complete Online Adventures', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Be the hero of your own <i>Star Wars</i>™ adventures in a galaxy far, far away.  <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies: The Complete Online Adventures is the most complete <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies experience ever, and now includes <i>An Empire Divided</i>™, <i>Jump to Lightspeed</i>™, <i>Rage of the Wookiees</i>™, and <i>Trials of Obi-Wan</i>™, plus the all new <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies™ Trading Card Game: Champions of the Force!</p>
<ul><br>
<h2>In <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies:</h2>
<p></p>
<li>Experience the complete <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies game: "<i>An Empire Divided</i>™," the expansions "<i>Jump to Lightspeed</i>™," "<i>Rage of the Wookiees</i>™," and "<i>Trials of Obi-Wan</i>™". 
					<li>Embark on adventures inspired by the classic trilogy, the prequel movies including <i>Star Wars</i>: Episode III <i>Revenge of the Sith</i>™ and the new horror novel, Death Troopers. 
					<li>Undertake hundreds of <i>Star Wars</i> missions to places like Jabba''s Palace, the Ewok Village, the Mos Eisley Cantina, the royal city of Theed and Hoth! 
					<li>Work for, or against, classic characters like Darth Vader, Jabba the Hutt, Han Solo and Princess Leia. 
					<li>Race speeder bikes, swoop bikes, landspeeders and podracers, or mount creatures like banthas and dewbacks. 
					<li>Master the wild with exclusive new abilities that let you create and customize your own beastly companion. 
					<li>Plus, join your friends in all new heroic encounters battling such enemies as IG88, the Tusken King, Exar Kun, and Axkva Min and the Death Troopers invasion.
					</li></li></li></li></li></li></li></br></ul><br>
<h2>In the <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies Trading Card Game:</h2>
<p>The Galactic Civil War continues on a whole new playing field with the introduction of the <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies™ Trading Card Game and its first release, Champions of the Force, the first ever online <i>Star Wars</i> trading card game.</p>
<ul>
<li>Choose your allegiance from one of four factions, Rebel, Imperial, Jedi or Sith, and build your own Light or Dark side digital card decks 
					<li>Collect more than 250 beautifully detailed original <i>Star Wars</i>-themed digital cards 
					<li>Challenge your skills online in solo play, or join with friends in epic one-on-one matches, cooperative Heroic Encounters and even official tournaments 
					<li>Discover more than 20 digital loot cards in the first release that are redeemable for fantastic digital items within the <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies massively multiplayer online game  for players with a <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies account in good standing* 
					<li>Plus, all <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies subscribers with current, valid, paid accounts in good standing are eligible to automatically receive five digital trading card Booster Packs each month included with their paid <i>Star Wars</i> Galaxies subscription at no additional cost
					</li></li></li></li></li></ul><br>
</br></br></p>', 'header.jpg');


