VALUES (24740, 'Burnout Paradise: The Ultimate Box', 87, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/burnoutparadise', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Burnout Paradise The Ultimate Box brings together the best console racing game of 2008, Burnout Paradise, with a host of great new content including motorbikes and exciting new online modes and challenges.</p>
<p>PC owners can look forward to spectacular visuals, incredible high speed racing, outrageous bone jarring crashes and a lifetime''s worth of fun and challenging online modes for up to 8 players to enjoy.</p>
<p>Players can also keep up to date with all the latest news and developments through the new Criterion Games Network and get the latest new game updates from the in game Burnout Store.</p>
</p>', 'header.jpg');


