-- Package information
-- Supreme Ruler 2020 (App ID: 25910)
VALUES (25910, 'Supreme Ruler 2020', 66, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/supremeruler2020', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p>
<p>Fueled by oil, political instability, and regional disparity, the world descends into chaos. Overnight, the value of an American dollar dropped 10%.  Drastic actions by many western governments managed to stall the descent, but the dollar continued to decline.</p>
<p>The resulting economic impact echoed across the globe and as US ability to police other nations dwindled and died, assorted regions seized the opportunity to encroach on their weaker neighbours amidst this anarchy  the time has come for you to take control in this geo-political strategy game. Will your leadership take you to new heights of power, or will you be nothing more than a footnote in history?</p>
<p>Key features: </p>
<ul>
<li>Choose from hundreds of actual military vehicles to research, build, and deploy </li>
<li>Detailed political, diplomatic and economic models</li>
<li>Choose your command from over 250 regions, worldwide</li>
<li>Streamlined Interface for easier play options.</li>
<li>Single or multiplayer support: up to 16 players over Internet or LAN </li>
<li>Super Sandbox Mode, for the last word in customization and replay value</li>
</ul>
</p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (25910, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'E10+');



