<li><strong>DirectX®:</strong> DirectX 9.0c or later</li>
<li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 120 MB Free Space</li>
<li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card</li>
</ul>
</ul>');




-- Package information
-- Media for parent App ID 26500 (from page App ID: 26510)

-- Smashing Toys (App ID: 26700)
VALUES (26700, 'Smashing Toys', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Enchanted by a terrible magic, a factory of toys must join a frenzied race to stay alive. They will have to cross industrial parks, funfairs and a forest to reach the promised island of eternal life.</p>
<p>Race for your toy''s life - against other players or in single-player mode. Just don''t let your vehicle fall apart.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Multiplayer Team Fight</strong>  Race and compete against opponents to win points and customize your vehicle to win!</li>
<li><strong>Breakable Toys</strong>  Blow parts off your competitors to earn more points. Hit jumps and collect bonus objects to repair your own toys and vehicles.</li>
<li><strong>3 Different Worlds and 25 Levels</strong>  Race in the factory, the funfair and the forest across more than 25 levels in either single-player or multiplayer modes.</li>
</ul>
</p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (26700, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'RP');






