<li><strong>Memory: </strong>1 GB RAM</li>
<li><strong>Hard Disk Space: </strong>40 MB</li>
<li><strong>Video Card: </strong>NVIDIA® GeForce™ or better, DirectX® 9.0c compatible video card, Shader Model 3.0 required. Video card must have 256 MB</li>
<li><strong>Sound Card: </strong>DirectX® 9.0c compatible sound card</li>
<li><strong>Additional Requirements: </strong>NET 2.0 Framework, XNA 3.0 support</li>
<li><strong>DirectX® Version: </strong>DirectX® 9.0c</li>
</ul>
</ul>');




