-- Package information
-- Paws and Claws: Pampered Pets (App ID: 33700)
VALUES (33700, 'Paws and Claws: Pampered Pets', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Only the best for your pets! Luxury and extravagance are the way of life at the Pampered Pets Spa.  Let the pampering begin!</p>
<ul>
<li>Time for TLC! Welcome your clients to your Pampered Pets Spa to style and spoil your pets.
								<li>Bling! Create custom diamond collars, sequined bags and more in your very own Pet Shop.
								<li>Posh pad!  Welcome your VIPets to their very own luxurious themed room including the Pretty in Purple and You’re a Movie Star rooms. 
								<li>Secret to Success! Grow your Pet Spa business as you receive gold star recommendations from your satisfied customers.
								<li>Spare No Expense!  Expand your custom treatments such as water aerobics and acupuncture in the Wellness Center.
								<li>Pamper your VIPets with nothing but the best treatments including massage therapy and oxygen tents.
								<li>Become the star of the business welcoming your guests with a limo ride from the airport.  
								<li>Offer your Pet Spa customers posh accessories and lavish personal pet rooms.
							</li></li></li></li></li></li></li></li></ul></p>', 'header.jpg');


