-- Package information
-- Family Feud Collection (App ID: 37920)
VALUES (37920, 'Family Feud Collection', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Includes all four installments of Family Feud, the fast-paced game based on the successful TV game show.</p><br>
<img align="left" src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/37920/extras/logo_1.jpg" style="margin-right:10px; padding-bottom:4px;"/>
<p>In <i>Family Feud: Battle of the Sexes</i>, the hit game has taken on life''s most rousing subject: love! Why doesn''t he call when he says he will? What move did 37% of people say ruins a passionate moment? Get answers to the hysterical questions that you''ve always pondered, but never asked, by playing Family Feud: Battle of the Sexes today.</p>
<ul>
<li>1500 questions give you a glimpse into the many stages of love</li>
<li>Beat the average score, or challenge a loved one</li>
<li>Lively host, music and sounds create a great game show feel</li>
<li>Funny facts and surprising insights</li>
</ul><br><br>
<img align="left" src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/37920/extras/logo_2.jpg" style="margin-right:10px; padding-bottom:4px;"/>
<p>One hundred people were surveyed. Their sometimes surprising, often hysterical answers await in <i>Family Feud: Dream Home</i>, the latest sequel to the popular series. Play against the average score, or challenge a friend in 2-player mode. Earn points to customize your dream home. Modern and neutral, or teeming with color--it''s up to you. With almost 3000 questions and a home decorating feature, hours of fun included.</p>
<ul>
<li>Almost 3000 brand new questions</li>
<li>Innovative twist on ageless fun, decorate your dream house</li>
<li>Gameshow feel, with dynamic host and captivating music</li>
<li>Play solo or with the whole family</li>
<li>Buy over 150 different houseold items with your points</li>
<li>Enjoy classic Family Feud fun AND endless decorating dreams</li>
</ul><br><br>
<img align="left" src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/37920/extras/logo_3.jpg" style="margin-right:10px; padding-bottom:4px;"/>
<p><i>Family Feud</i> is the fast-paced game based on the successful TV game show! Beat the average score, or go head-to-head with a friend or an entire family! Pass, Play, Steal and Strike -with over two thousand questions! Survey says: Play Family Feud!</p>
<ul>
<li>Over 2,000 new survey questions and 10,000 answers</li>
<li>Cool awards for bragging rights</li>
<li>Great game host, stunning graphics and captivating music</li>
<li>Survey says: The most fun game show ever</li>
</ul><br><br>
<img align="left" src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/37920/extras/logo_4.jpg" style="margin-right:10px; padding-bottom:4px;"/>
<p>Also includes the original <i>Family Feud</i> with over 2,000 unique questions and 10,000 answers!</p><br><br/><br/>
</br></br></br></br></br></br></br></br></p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (37920, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'E');



