VALUES (38460, 'MDK 2', 83, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/mdk2', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p>
<p>3 Unlikely Heroes, 1 Ultimate Goal</p>
<p>Kurt Hectic is back to save the universe. This time he is teamed with the genius Dr. Hawkins and the 6-legged gun-toting robotic dog, Max. Together they must out-sneak, out-blast and out-think their enemies as they attempt to reclaim earth from a vile alien menace.</p>
</p>', 'header.jpg');


