-- Media for parent App ID 39800 (from page App ID: 39810)

-- Fallen Earth (App ID: 40000)
VALUES (40000, 'Fallen Earth', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><!---
<br />
<h2>Six Steam exclusive in-game faction t-shirts - Nov 26-29</h2>
<p>Players who purchase Fallen Earth through Steam during the promotion will receive immediate access to the game and a t-shirt voucher for an exclusive faction-related t-shirt of their choice.  Players will have the opportunity to trade in vouchers at a number of NPCs throughout the game for one of the six t-shirts, each of which displays a faction logo — CHOTA, Enforcers, Lightbearers, Techs, Travelers or Vistas. When worn, the t-shirt will provide the equivalent of a level 10 shirt armor piece, with specific t-shirt stats customized to each faction’s strengths.</p>
<br />
<table width=460 border=0>
<tr>
<td><img src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/901179/extras/chota.jpg" width=150><br>CHOTA: <br />+3 Melee, +3 Scavenging</td>
<td><img src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/901179/extras/enforcer.jpg" width=150><br>Enforcer:  <br />+3 Rifle, +3 Geology</td>
<td><img src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/901179/extras/lightbearer.jpg" width=150><br>Lightbearer: <br />+3 Melee, +3 Nature</td>
</tr>
<tr><td><br /></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr>
