-- Nancy Drew® Dossier: Resorting to Danger! en Steam (App ID: 42200)
VALUES (42200, 'Nancy Drew® Dossier: Resorting to Danger! en Steam', 86, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/nancydrewdossierresortingtodanger', '<h2>Acerca del juego</h2>
<p><p>From the creators of the #1 selling-PC adventure games comes a new Nancy Drew story-driven casual series that is Fast Fun for Busy DetectivesTM.  Nancy Drew Dossier hidden-object games immerse you in a suspense-filled hunt to piece together concealed clues as you search and seek to crack the case.  A bomber plagues the Redondo Spa!  Can you defuse the situation? The annoying explosives are pranks, but it could drive away the Redondo’s clients and celebrities. Nab the culprit or you’re out of business!</p>
<ul>
<li>Six ways to solve the case
					<li>Replay exciting mini-games in Arcade Mode
					<li>Earn bonus points to unlock extra content
					<li>Combine clues to solve puzzles!
					</li></li></li></li></ul>
<br clear="all"/>
<p>�</p>
<h2>About The Nancy Drew Dossier Series</h2>
<div><p><img align="left" src="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps_extras/31870/DossierLogo.jpg"/><br/>A hidden-object puzzle mystery that’s Fast Fun for Busy Detectives. <br/>See a <a href="http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps_extras/NancyDrewCompare/english.htm">comparison</a> of the Dossier and Adventure Series</p>
</div></p>', 'header.jpg');


