<p><p>
<p>Meet the Engineer, one of nine playable character classes in Team Fortress 2:  </p>
<p><b>Name:</b> Engineer<br/><b>Role:</b> Defense<br/><b>Weapons:</b> Shotgun / Pistol/ Wrench <br/><b>Contraptions:</b> Turret / Dispenser / Teleporter<br/><b>Favorite Equation:</b></p>
<p><img alt"fav="" equation"="" src="http://cdn.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps_extras/987/equation.gif"/></p>
<p>This amiable, soft-spoken good ol'' boy from tiny Bee Cave, Texas loves barbeque, guns, and higher education. Natural curiosity, ten years as a roughneck in the west Texas oilfields, and eleven hard science PhDs have trained him to design, build and repair a variety of deadly contraptions.</p></p></p>', 'capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1257358745');

