<p><p>
<p>Meet the Heavy Weapons Guy, one of nine playable character classes in Team Fortress 2:  </p>
<p><b>Name:</b> Heavy Weapons Guy<br/><b>Role:</b> Defense<br/><b>Weapons:</b> Chain Gun / Shotgun / Giant Fists <br/></p>
<p>Like a hibernating bear, the Heavy appears to be a gentle giant. Also like a bear, confusing his deliberate, sleepy demeanor with gentleness will get you ripped limb from limb. Though he speaks simply and moves with an economy of energy that''s often confused with napping, the Heavy isn''t dumb, he''s not your big friend, and he generally wishes you''d just shut up before he has to make you shut up.</p></p></p>', 'capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1261359291');

-- Media for parent App ID 1200 (from page App ID: 961)
<p>New for Spring 2007, Red Orchestra: Ostfront 41-45 is updated with a wealth of new features: 10 new community-made maps; support for 50+ player battles; new content, including the Russian BT-7 light tank with infantry tank riders and the first player controllable anti-tank gun in the game; updated artwork and music; several features requested by the clan/ladder/league community to enhance competitive play; and a heap of other enhancements.</p>', 'capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1254347046');

