<p>
<p>Experience fully interactive scenarios and discover the secrets behind two paramilitary operatives, Lincoln Graves and Reggie Lang in Conflict: Denied Ops, the fifth installment in the best-selling Conflict series.</p>
<p> Conflict: Denied Ops is a highly accessible co-op FPS featuring massive, extremely explosive firefights across destructible environments.  Work as a team to utilize the specific skills of each operative and experience the ultimate in destructive satisfaction with tons of exploding objects and an endless barrage of terrorists who are begging to be blown to hell.</p>
