VALUES (8260, 'Sam & Max 201: Ice Station Santa', 82, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/samandmaxepisode201icestationsanta', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Hes the most ancient and powerful opponent theyve ever faced, a hairy, bloated, pagan God - Santa Claus! With Christmas presents on the attack and carols of gunshots drowning out the bells, Sam &amp; Max must storm the North Pole to bring down a less-than-jolly foe. Can the Freelance Police make sense of this Christmas conundrum in time to save the world''s children from a holiday tainted by tears, turmoil, and Torture-Me-Elmer?</p>
