VALUES (8300, 'Sam & Max 205: Whats New Beelzebub?', 85, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/samandmaxepisode205whatsnewbeelzebub', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Judgment day is at hand, and its time for a showdown with the guy downstairs to bargain for Boscos soul. But in the corporate wasteland known as Hell, not even the Freelance Police are safe from eternal damnation. Can Sam &amp; Max fight free from Satans grasp, or have they reached the end of the line?</p>
