VALUES (8310, 'Bone: Out From Boneville no Steam', 68, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/bone', '<h2>Acerca do jogo</h2>
<p><p>After an attack by a swarm of locusts leaves Fone Bone lost in the mountains, he sets out to find his cousins, with a little help from a mysterious red dragon, a couple of talking bugs, and a pretty girl named Thorn. But with hungry rat creatures on his tail, will Fone Bone ever make his way back to Boneville?</p></p>', 'header.jpg');


