VALUES (8320, 'Bone: The Great Cow Race', 76, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/bonethegreatcowrace', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>It''s spring fair time and The Great Cow Race is about to begin! Play carnival games. Write love poetry. Outsmart a really big bee. Cheat the locals out of their hard-earned eggs. Bang on some pots and pans. Escape from an angry mob. Oh, and dress up like a cow. (Not necessarily in that order.)</p></p>', 'header.jpg');


