<li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li>
<li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9 compatible graphics card with 512 MB memory, Nvidia 6800 or better</li>
<li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX 9 compatible</li>
<li><strong>Direct X Version:</strong> 9</li>
<li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 2.5 GB free space</li>
<li><strong>Input Devices: </strong>DirectX 9 compatible force feedback steering wheel</li>
<li>*Limited support</li> </ul> </ul>');




-- Package information
-- Media for parent App ID 8690 (from page App ID: 8700)

-- Media for parent App ID 8660 (from page App ID: 8720)
<p><p>The official demo for GTR Evolution includes Brands Hatch 07 and the Sunred Sr21 race car.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Sunred</strong> is a Spanish built supercar hailing from Barcelona and aiming to become a serious threat to the more established teams in current GT racing. A Judd V10 delivers around 500 horsepower, enough to propel the 1100 kilos around any track at breathtaking speeds. In this demo the Sunred Sr21 is available in the distinct cool Logitech green or in the blue and white of MotorsTV.</li>
<li><strong>Brands Hatch</strong> is an old favorite and any SimBin fan will have driven countless laps in search for the perfect lap.  Drivers new to Brands Hatch will note the feared first dipping turn, get that one wrong and you are in big trouble before the lap has even really started. Brands hatch is a drivers track and a true challenge of skill and nerves when attempting to tame it in a powerful GT car.</li> </ul>
<p>When you feel confident in your ability to power the Sunred around Brands Hatch, then jump online and show the world your skills... or join just to have fun with friends. The demo has full online capability, and you are certain to face great drivers from all over the world when you decide to take the step into multiplayer gaming.</p> </p>', 'capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1254347044');
-- Puzzlegeddon (App ID: 8740)
VALUES (8740, 'Puzzlegeddon', 74, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/puzzlegeddon', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Puzzle, collect resources and defeat opponents in Puzzlegeddon  an inventive puzzle brawler for brain and brawn.</p>
<p>Puzzlegeddon features a clever mix of puzzle, action and strategy. Select your island of choice and puzzle for resources to defend yourself and to defeat opponents throughout the many galaxies, game modes and challenges in the world of Puzzlegeddon.</p>
<p>Join the battles online or challenge yourself in one of the addicting single player modes, Puzzlegeddon is a game for all tastes and play styles which challenges players to think hard, play smart and act fast!</p>
<p>The game is colorful, charming and with an oddball personality to go with it the game has more in common with a crazy party game than your standard puzzler.</p>
<p>Puzzlegeddon doesn''t require a powerful computer to look great and the game is fully playable with just a mouse or an Xbox 360 controller for Windows.</p>
<ul>
<li>Puzzle. Collect resources. Defeat opponents. Puzzlegeddon is a unique experience for brainiacs and painiacs alike</li>
<li>Choose between the many playable islands with their own unique themes and special skills</li>
<li>Diverse multiplayer modes for up to 6 players online </li>
<li>Fight evil robots or puzzle for survival on a poisonous planet in the game''s challenging and addictive single player modes</li>
<li>Get defeated and enter The Dead Puzzler''s Challenge, a fun mini-game in the realm of the dead</li>
<li>Incredibly easy to create or join game sessions</li>
<li>Beat records and improve stats</li>
</ul></p>', 'header.jpg');


VALUES (8740, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);



<ul>
<li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows® XP/Vista™</li>
<li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium® 4, AMD Athlon™ XP 2 GHz or compatible</li>
<li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM</li>
<li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Pixelshader 2.0 compatible graphics card with 128 MB memory</li>
<li><strong>DirectX® Version:</strong> 9.0c (included)</li>
<li><strong>Hard Drive:</strong> 250 MB free space</li>
<li><strong>Sound:</strong> OS-supported sound card</li>
<li><strong>Supported Controller:</strong>Xbox 360™ controller for Windows®</li>
</ul> </ul>');




