-- Gametrailers TV Episode 106 Promo sur Steam (App ID: 99033)
VALUES (99033, 'Gametrailers TV Episode 106 Promo sur Steam', '<h2>Au sujet de cette vidéo</h2>
<p>GameTrailers TV with Geoff Keighley visits Valve to ask the questions every gamer wants to know. Will Valve release a sequel to The Orange Box? What about Portal and Counter-Strike? Will Valve be developing games for the Wii? Plus, we deliver exclusive information about the next addition to the Valve store, the rebirth of a classic Team Fortress map AND reveal the real-world bakery behind the most famous virtual cake on earth. But don''t forget the Zombies! We have exclusive new footage from Left4Dead! 

The show debuts at 1am on SPIKE, but if you miss the show, you can download high definition versions of GameTrailers TV on GameTrailers.com.
</p>', '');


VALUES (99033, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);


