VALUES (32310, 'Indiana Jones® and the Last Crusade™', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Europe, 1938: The lost Ark was just a warm-up! Now Adolf Hitler is after the most powerful talisman of all - the Holy Grail. A few brave men stand in his way. Fortunately, one of them is Indiana Jones, and this time he has his dad with him.</p>
<p>The bad guys are in your face all the way – mercenaries, traitors and spies. Not to mention everything the Luftwaffe can throw at you.... Can you handle the heat?</p>
<p>If you can, you just might earn a higher I.Q. (Indy Quotient) than the man with the whip and the hat.</p>
<ul>
