VALUES (32330, 'LEGO� Indiana Jones: The Original Adventures', 78, 'http://www.metacritic.com/games/platforms/pc/legoindianajonestheoriginaladventures', '<h2>About the Game</h2>
<p><p>Build, Battle and Brawl your way out of trouble!</p>
<p>Play through all three classic Indiana Jones movies and relive your favorite Indy adventures in the tongue-in-cheek worlds of LEGO�.</p>
